      "statement": "The Docker image installs the package with the EXTRAS build argument (default chatbot), asserts at build time that the installed dtcc-core commit equals the pyproject pin, sets DTCC_AGENT_ARTIFACTS_DIR=/data/artifacts, runs as a non-root user, and by default starts the chatbot on port 8050.",
